+### Diarization, VAD, and Speech Intelligence
+
+#### [pyannote-audio](https://github.com/pyannote/pyannote-audio)
+> **Description:** `pyannote.audio` is one of the strongest open source speaker diarization toolkits on GitHub. Its README centers on pretrained pipelines for speaker diarization, speaker change detection, overlapped speech detection, and related building blocks. In a podcast context, that helps transform a noisy two- or three-person interview into structured speaker segments that editors, chaptering tools, and note-generation workflows can use. GitHub shows a permissive MIT license and a very active research-to-production community.
+
