+> **Description:** Whisper is the reference open source speech recognition model most podcasters start with. The GitHub README describes it as a general-purpose model that handles multilingual speech recognition, speech translation, and language identification from a single multitask model. For podcasters, that makes it a solid base for raw episode transcription, foreign-language excerpts, and downstream show-note generation. GitHub shows a very large community around the project and an MIT license that fits commercial and internal production workflows.
+
