+## Quality Bar
+
+- Prefer tools with active maintenance or clear long-term usefulness.
+- Prefer projects with enough documentation for real adoption.
+- Avoid duplicate repos that solve the same job unless there is a meaningful difference in approach.
+- If a category has fewer than 5 good repos, keep the gap explicit instead of padding the list.
