+#### [whisper.cpp](https://github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp)
+> **Description:** `whisper.cpp` ports Whisper to portable C/C++ inference, making it attractive for lightweight, local, or embedded podcast workflows. The README emphasizes plain CPU execution, broad platform support, and simple command-line usage, which is useful for creators who want a local transcript tool without a heavier Python runtime. It also has a large ecosystem of wrappers and integrations around it. The project is permissively licensed and remains one of the most referenced Whisper derivatives on GitHub.
+
+- **GitHub:** [github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp](https://github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp)
