+> **Description:** `resemble-enhance` is an AI-powered speech denoising and enhancement project aimed directly at improving voice quality. Its README positions it as a tool for speech enhancement rather than general music mastering, which is exactly what podcasters need for dialogue-heavy recordings. It can help improve clarity, presence, and perceived polish before final mixdown or transcription. GitHub shows a growing community around the project and a Python-based implementation.
