+# Contributing
+
+Thanks for contributing to `awesome-best-ai-tools-for-podcasters-2026`.
+
+## Submission Requirements
+
+- Every submission must include a public `github.com` repository URL.
+- No proprietary SaaS-only tools.
+- The repo must be relevant to podcast production, publishing, repurposing, or archive workflows.
+- Include the current GitHub stars count, primary language, license, and a recent public activity date.
+- If the repo is archived, beta-quality, or has licensing limits, note that clearly.
+
+## Preferred Submission Format
+
+Use this template in your pull request or issue:
+
+```md
+#### [Tool Name](https://github.com/username/repo)
+> **Description:** Short summary based on the GitHub README and why podcasters would care.
+
