+#### [whisper-timestamped](https://github.com/linto-ai/whisper-timestamped)
+> **Description:** `whisper-timestamped` focuses on what podcasters usually need after transcription: word-level timestamps and confidence. The README explains that it augments Whisper with dynamic time warping on attention weights to produce better word timing and segment accuracy than the base model alone. It also documents optional VAD integration, plotting, and timestamp utilities. That makes it useful for clipping, quote extraction, and subtitle timing when exact words must align to spoken audio.
+
