+> **Description:** Open-Unmix is another strong open source music source separation option, built in PyTorch and documented around reusable models and evaluation assets. For podcasters it is not usually the first stop for speech enhancement, but it is helpful when episodes include intros, live music, or mixed recordings that need stem extraction. It is also valuable as a baseline or alternative to Demucs when building self-hosted audio pipelines. The codebase is straightforward enough to adapt.
