+#### [TTS](https://github.com/coqui-ai/TTS)
+> **Description:** Coqui TTS is one of the most mature open source text-to-speech toolkits on GitHub. The README presents it as a research-and-production toolkit spanning TTS, vocoders, speaker encoders, and voice conversion. For podcasters, that means one repo can cover intros, ad reads, multilingual variants, accessibility voiceovers, and experimentation with cloned or synthetic narration. It is heavier than a single-purpose TTS engine, but the breadth and community support are major strengths.
